<description>&lt;p&gt;Drone strikes have become a major source of fatalities, with Sudan drones responsible for nearly three quarters of war deaths this year and South Sudan accusing Sudan of a drone attack that killed scores in a disputed area. A priest who fled South Sudan was murdered in Birmingham, while a pastor was jailed in South Sudan for performing a Christian song with musical instruments. The government screened out 54 children from a police recruitment drive and SPLM Jonglei chairperson candidates began their race without primaries in Pigi County, where a chairperson was injured in a road incident. Protesters demanded inclusion in the UNISFA mandate drafting, and UCDP recorded two battle-related deaths in 2024.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinwFBVV95cUxNdUJSbXNpWnNOV21DVGRZNTR4SDJzT2NTNWE2WmFGcDBaNVNQOEpNNXk5eVdvQkYzSEV2ZmJRYWswX2xqb1B1TGpUckFqMVRudm9YY29Ud19RX2xhaXhrVkVQSDFhamk0d0FmX213NTFpWk56OVdvRVk2RjNSNlRnQ0xfcGtZc3hJOHdJSlBPa3pESWxLYnA4MTlVaEw0TE0?oc=5&quot;&gt;OCHA&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivAFBVV95cUxNUzVVZlh0cUIxWFBYU2NGYnZWdHZmc1RLY3oyNm51NTlQQjJEMFlVclNsN2tWM0FjMmRycVdsMXQ2WW4xeUJZYVR1V3lac2ZBTmJ4RWcxYXVxaFlGV1dNbXM3OG5FOXhheVdiM0dzUVktZnJZZkQxNUU4ZWZuM0lWV2JyZXVKUXZtcDl2RHVaTVRtRGN1ZFdPckdPQ0dZSFI1SDVfVGlPbWhYa0o0alNCNFdsSDgtUkhxakRWZw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Eye Radio&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Eye Radio&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Eye Radio&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Eye Radio&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirAFBVV95cUxNMmJRZmNjYi1aWTVCOGc4VTZkUzVxR1k0bW5pUS1ZZGpFZEYtYmQ0Zm9SVmZ2ZFdna3RNRWhQRV9lNk1IaVRqb1JhdTdxbHRsTmdtWVpmdGZMSjFFMU